 the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 6 grids runs 75 years, from 1951 to 2025. October to November came in under 90% of normal in 38 of those years, more often than any other pair. In 2025 the middle saw January to February at 21% of normal and June to July at 189%. Grid 27748 had its driest year in 1989 at 49%.</p>"}
